# Comment Guidelines

- Only exported identifiers need Go‑doc comments; keep them single‑sentence.
- Inline comments **only** where the code’s intent is non‑obvious.
- No commented‑out code; delete or move to VCS history.
- All comments should have a period at the end of them.
